HST: Ctrl+Alt+Q starts a new equation, as MathType's key does in Word

Users who come from Word with MathType start an inline equation with Ctrl+Alt+Q. The key was free
in every application; it now runs the command of the Insert tab's equation button: Writer (text and
master documents) and Sheets insert a new empty formula with .uno:InsertObjectStarMath, Slides and
Draw with .uno:InsertMath. The formula opens in the HST Công thức editor (the Math editor with the
template bar and the Elements panel). Menus and ribbon tooltips show the key from the accelerator
configuration as usual.

Test: CppunitTest_sw_hst_equation_shortcut.

